doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport", content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Welcome to Task Tracker
  body(style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f8; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #334155; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;")
    table(role="presentation", width="100%", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0", border="0", style="width: 100%; background-color: #f4f6f8; padding: 40px 15px;")
      tr
        td(align="center")
          table(role="presentation", width="100%", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0", border="0", style="max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;")
            
            tr
              td(style="background-color: #4f46e5; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #4f46e5 100%); padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center;")
                h1(style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px; font-family: inherit;") TaskTracker

            tr
              td(style="padding: 32px 28px;")
                h2(style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;") Hi #{fullname || name || 'there'},
                p(style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 24px;")
                  | Welcome to #[strong TaskTracker]! We're excited to have you on board. To activate your account and start managing your tasks, please verify your email address by clicking the button below:
                
                div(style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;")
                  a(href=verifyUrl || actionUrl, target="_blank", style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);") Verify Your Account
                
                table(role="presentation", width="100%", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0", border="0", style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1; margin-bottom: 24px;")
                  tr
                    td(style="padding: 16px 20px;")
                      p(style="margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;")
                        strong Note: 
                        | This verification link will expire in #{expiresIn || '24 hours'}.
                p(style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 24px;")
                  | If you're having trouble clicking the button, copy and paste the URL below into your browser:
                  br
                  a(href=verifyUrl || actionUrl, target="_blank", style="color: #4f46e5; word-break: break-all; text-decoration: underline;") #{verifyUrl || actionUrl}

                table(role="presentation", width="100%", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0", border="0", style="background-color: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1; margin-bottom: 28px;")
                  tr
                    td(style="padding: 20px;")
                      h3(style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b;") Quick Start Guide:
                      h3(style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b;") What's next after verifying?
                      ul(style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;")
                        li(style="margin-bottom: 6px;") Create tasks and set priorities
                        li(style="margin-bottom: 6px;") Keep track of deadlines and status
                        li(style="margin-bottom: 0;") Boost your daily productivity seamlessly
                div(style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;")
                  a(href=actionUrl || dashboardUrl || "http://localhost:3000/dashboard", target="_blank", style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px;") Go to Your Dashboard
                
                p(style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 0;")
                  | If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to reply directly to this email.
            
            tr
              td(style="padding: 20px 28px 28px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; background-color: #fafafa;")
                p(style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;")
                  | © #{new Date().getFullYear()} TaskTracker. All rights reserved.
                  br
                  | If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email.